commits_data.message:
TPNCP: Improve RtpState resolving

On 7.4 an additional field was added to the RtpState struct.

ActivateRtpRtcp layout ends with:
{
    RtpState RTPRxState;
    RtpState RTPTxState;
    unsigned int StateUpdateTimeStamp;
}

but RtpState itself was extended, so we have to calculate the offsets
accordingly.
